; HOME, SETXY (draws like FD: every cell but the last), SETHEADING and the
; XCOR/YCOR/HEADING reporters. "SETXY 3 -2" is two inputs (minus rule).
SCREEN 20 6
PU SETXY 3 -2 SET a XCOR SET b YCOR
HOME SET c XCOR SET d YCOR
SETH 450 SET h HEADING
RT -100 SET h2 HEADING
PD SETXY 15 3
SETXY 15 5
SETH 0 FD 2
